<title>FINLAND: Finnish September jobless rate 15.1 pct - SF.</title>
<headline>Finnish September jobless rate 15.1 pct - SF.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finnish unemployment rate fell to 15.1 pct in September from 15.9 percent in August and it fell 1.3 percentage points from September last year, Statistics Finland (SF) said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>  Sept 1996     Aug 1996	September 1995</p>
<p> Unemployed	    370,000	403,000	406,000</p>
<p> Jobless rate (pct)   15.1	   15.9	  16.4</p>
<p>NOTE - The above figures are not seasonally adjusted. Finland's labour ministry, calculating on a different basis, earlier said the September unemployment rate fell to 16.7 percent from 17.2 percent in August.</p>
</text>
